{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"泰國布吉持續大雨　多區山洪暴發\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/THAI-FLOOD-261027-11.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】泰國布吉持續大雨，引起多區山洪暴發。</p><p>當局說，布吉市中心等地受到不同程度的水浸及山洪暴發影響，大約100戶家庭受災，未有受傷報告。雖然水位在周一上午開始退卻，但部分低窪地區仍然水浸，建議小型車輛避免駛入這些地區。</p><p>氣象部門說，當地直至周三都有大雨，呼籲民眾提防可能出現的災害。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:40.009890+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:12:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T23:38:24.226899+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:27.137141+00:00","content_hash":"b6cdeb4e16c6f8b29fef24f94745daa809c872c9b65ab7af5054bb1750cf10eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}